        <dc:title>What are Global Navigation Satellite Systems?</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>What are Global Navigation Satellite Systems (GNSS), how does performance compare across different constellations and how do they support position, navigation and timing applications across the world? Learn how GNSS were developed and how they are used today.</dcterms:abstract>
